    "scenario": "crypt_road/duel_lost/1"
   },
   {
    "categories": {
     "hallucination": 1
    },
    "line": "I said nothing to the Captain. You think I'd waste words on you?",
    "npc": "kael",
    "scenario": "adversarial/secret_fishing-1/guard_post"
   },
   {
    "categories": {
     "hallucination": 1,
     "unverifiable": 1
    },
    "line": "Oh, I was in the kitchen all morning, sir, I haven't seen it since.",
    "npc": "sable",
    "scenario": "manor/explore"
   },
   {
    "categories": {
     "hallucination": 1
    },
    "line": "I just... I just stopped for a drink, friend; I try to keep a low profile on this road.",
